warning[almost_swapped]: this sets both `a` and `b` to `b`
  --> tests/lint/almost_swapped/bad.jai:11:5
   |
11 |     a = b;
   |     ^^^^^^
   |
   = help: to swap them, write `a, b = b, a;`
   = note: `almost_swapped` is `warn` by default

warning[almost_swapped]: this sets both `p.first` and `p.second` to `p.second`
  --> tests/lint/almost_swapped/bad.jai:14:5
   |
14 |     p.first = p.second;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: to swap them, write `p.first, p.second = p.second, p.first;`
   = note: `almost_swapped` is `warn` by default

